_chemical_compound_source
;
cyclo-NMe-L-Ala-L-Ala (3) was synthesised from the corresponding
dipeptide ester following the procedures of Slater (1969).
The diketopiperazine was then treated with acetic anhydride (10 x mass)
at 293 K for 4 h. The desired compound (1) was purified by flash
chromatography and recrystallised from a solvent mixture of ethyl acetate and
petroleum spirit.
;
